# HW_SK             Huawei IAM Secret Access Key
# HW_SWR_ORG        e-khadi
# HW_SWR_LOGIN_KEY  Long password from SWR → Login Command
# ECS_HOST          110.238.73.51
# ECS_USER          ubuntu
# ECS_SSH_KEY       Contents of the private key file for the ECS instance
# DATABASE_URL      (same as above, for the container)
# DIRECT_URL        (same as above, for migrations)
